#. module: stock_account_multicompany_ux
#: model:res.groups,comment:stock_account_multicompany_ux.group_stock_all_branches
msgid ""
"Allows the user to see the stock detail of the whole parent/branches company"
" scheme, even for companies they cannot access. The quantity on hand keeps "
"showing the user's own companies; it is the location breakdown that lists "
"every warehouse of the group. Read only: the user still cannot write on the "
"other companies' records."
msgstr ""

