#. module: stock_account_multicompany_ux
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_account_multicompany_ux.field_product_category__shared_to_branches
msgid ""
"When enabled, all branches of the parent company will use the same costing method and standard price defined in the parent company for products in this category. This ensures a single unified cost across the parent and all its branches.\n"
"\n"
"This flag is company-dependent: it is edited on the group's root company and synced down to its branches, so each company group can decide independently which categories are shared."
msgstr ""
